  "goodToKnow": "Der Untertitel is a subtitle, in films and books. Germany has a strong dubbing tradition: most foreign films and series are synchronisiert, with famous voice actors who always dub the same Hollywood stars. Cinemas showing the original version mark it OV (Originalversion) or OmU (Original mit Untertiteln). Watching with German subtitles is a great learning trick. Plural: die Untertitel, dative den Untertiteln."
